e>Lambert</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Entwistle</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Forster</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Fullerton</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sheldon</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Watt</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A systematic review of the effectiveness of health service interventions aimed at reducing inequalities in health</article-title><source>Journal of Health Services &#x00026; Research Policy</source><year>1996</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>93</fpage><lpage>103</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10180855</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Acheson</surname><given-names>DB</given-names><suffix>D. Graham, H. Marmot, M. Whitehead, M</suffix></name></person-group><source>Independent inquiry into inequilities in health:report</source><year>1998</year><publisher-name>London , The Stationery Office</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>